{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The word came down in days of old
King Jehoiakim upon the [C]throne
[Dm]A test for those who lived as told
[Bb]The Recha[C]bites in their [Dm]home
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
To the [Bb]house of the Lord [C]I went
[Dm]Into a chamber set a[C]side
Where [Bb]the sons of [C]Hanan went
[Bb]With Ig[C]daliah by their [Dm]side
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
He was called the man of [Bb][C]God
A name of honor held in [Dm]trust
Beside the officials it [Bb]was
[C]Above the keeper of the [Dm]dust
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Bowls of wine were set before
The men who lived in tents all [C]days
But [Dm]they refused the liquid store
O[Bb]beying ancient [C]sacred [Dm]ways
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
He was called the man of [Bb][C]God
A name of honor held in [Dm]trust
Beside the officials it [Bb][C]was
Above the keeper of the [Dm]dust
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
Jonadab commanded them to keep
No houses sown or vines [C]to grow
They [Dm]answered with a promise deep
To [Bb]follow where their [C]fathers [Dm]go
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
In that chamber of the [Bb]Lord
[C]The man of God is remembered [Dm]well
{end_of_verse}
